## Hints for Future Agents
- The `codex` MCP server for Claude Code is written by the jq block in
  install.sh into ~/.claude.json. That file is NOT tracked here. If codex
  MCP stops working, look there, not in this repo.
- ~/.codex/config.toml is now a REAL FILE. Do not re-symlink it. That is
  the entire point of this commit.
- ~/.codex/skills/ also contains a `.system` directory that Codex manages.
  Do not delete the whole skills dir.
- Pi credentials, sessions, and memory live in ~/.pi/agent (auth.json,
  trust.json, sessions/, projects-memory/, pi-hermes-memory/). None of it
  was ever tracked and none of it was touched.
- The Pi binary is still installed. Removing it from .mise.toml stops mise
  from managing it but does not uninstall it.
- install.sh:66 still has a stale comment referencing extraKnownMarketplaces,
  which was removed in commit 5d9fe2c. Harmless, but wrong.

